              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": [
                0,
                0,
                6,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tNInb",
                  "name": "Chapter No",
                  "fill": "$night-amber",
                  "content": "第 128 章",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 3
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vS5cs",
                  "name": "Chapter Title",
                  "fill": "$night-text",
                  "content": "雪夜入城，旧人未归",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                  "fontSize": 26,
                  "fontWeight": "900",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "NTQuV",
                  "name": "Rule",
                  "fill": "$night-amber",
                  "width": 28,
                  "height": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "y7tcS",
              "name": "Para 1",
              "fill": "$night-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　城门在身后缓缓合上，雪落得更急了。他立在长街尽头，望着那盏许多年前就该熄灭的灯——它竟还亮着，昏黄一点，像谁不肯睡去的眼睛。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Txect",
              "name": "Para 2",
              "fill": "$night-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　守夜的老卒提着灯笼过来，照了照他的脸，又照了照他腰间那柄缠了布的剑，终究什么也没问，只说了一句：“今夜风大，客人早些歇着。”",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "C0pHW",
              "name": "Para 3",
              "fill": "$night-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　他点头道谢，却没有动。十年前也是这样一场雪，他从这条街出城，身后有人喊他的名字，他没有回头。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "al8H3",
              "name": "Para 4",
              "fill": "$night-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　如今他回来了，街还是那条街，喊他的人却不知去了哪里。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
