        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "IOtQC",
          "name": "Page",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 14,
          "padding": [
            92,
            26,
            48,
            26
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "q74aaW",
              "name": "Chapter Title",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "第 128 章　雪夜入城，旧人未归",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 21,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aPjBd",
              "name": "Para 1",
              "fill": "#2A241D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　城门在身后缓缓合上，雪落得更急了。他立在长街尽头，望着那盏许多年前就该熄灭的灯——它竟还亮着，昏黄一点，像谁不肯睡去的眼睛。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bdBIS",
              "name": "Para 2",
              "fill": "#2A241D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　守夜的老卒提着灯笼过来，照了照他的脸，又照了照他腰间那柄缠了布的剑，终究什么也没问，只说了一句：“今夜风大，客人早些歇着。”",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zEDhK",
              "name": "Para 3",
              "fill": "#2A241D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　他点头道谢，却没有动。十年前也是这样一场雪，他从这条街出城，身后有人喊他的名字，他没有回头。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Z4Fbg",
              "name": "Para 4",
              "fill": "#2A241D",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "　　如今他回来了，街还是那条街，喊他的人却不知去了哪里。",
              "lineHeight": 1.9,
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.3
            }
          ]
        },
